  "post_content": "<p>(12 fotos) El alumnado de la familia de Comercio y Marketing del IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; contin&uacute;a este viernes el mercadillo solidario con la Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer (ACCC).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/IMG_0233.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El jueves ya se ha podido visitar y se pueden comprar los productos realizados por alumnos y alumnas, principalmente con materiales reciclados.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0231.jpg\" alt=\"img_0231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0232.jpg\" alt=\"img_0232\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0233.jpg\" alt=\"img_0233\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0235.jpg\" alt=\"img_0235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0237.jpg\" alt=\"img_0237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0239.jpg\" alt=\"img_0239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0240.jpg\" alt=\"img_0240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0242.jpg\" alt=\"img_0242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetiessolidariaccc/img_0243.jpg